        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shark_demon",
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
          "loc_hai_shi_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Hei Lou Lan’s immortal ascension, Tai Bai Yun Sheng is still afflicted by death sentence awaits Immortal Gu and has promised Shark Demon to explore Yu Lu blessed land, so he sets out for eastern sea.",
        "chapters": [
          693
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "affliction-on-tai-bai-yun-sheng",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, while Fang Yuan seeks allies for Starry Sky grotto-heaven, Tai Bai Yun Sheng is with Shark Demon exploring that blessed land and cannot leave to help because of the same affliction.",
